{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105264","id":2452797540,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6SMrhk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105264","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105264.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105264.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105264","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105264/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105264/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105264/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9b6f9e5701240c053181c3b5ed99438049f08689","number":105264,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize PrimitiveMesh creation by avoiding CoW behavior and dynamic memory allocations","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I was profiling culling performance which required me to generated 20,000 Meshes at startup. I noticed that startup was taking a very long time (even with an optimized build). So I profiled it and found that half the time for generating Primitive meshes is spent in `Vector::push_back`. This is both because of the CoW behaviour and the memory allocations. Simply using LocalVectors and then converting to Vectors before returning the data roughly doubles performance. \r\n\r\nMore can be done to optimize these functions, but anything else would require a lot more intrusive changes and wouldn't yield the same benefit. \r\n\r\nRunning a quick benchmark (time to generate 2000 instances) over the changed Mesh types I get:\r\n\r\nBefore (4.4.1):\r\n```\r\nSphereMesh\r\n1.05062\r\nBoxMesh\r\n0.046538\r\nCapsuleMesh\r\n0.902834\r\nCylinderMesh\r\n0.246506\r\nPlaneMesh\r\n0.036552\r\nPrismMesh\r\n0.040652\r\nTorusMesh\r\n0.988274\r\nTubeTrailMesh\r\n0.163032\r\nRibbonTrailMesh\r\n0.097105\r\n```\r\nAfter (non-dev build but no LTO):\r\n```\r\nSphereMesh\r\n0.535162\r\nBoxMesh\r\n0.042593\r\nCapsuleMesh\r\n0.469328\r\nCylinderMesh\r\n0.146048\r\nPlaneMesh\r\n0.03898\r\nPrismMesh\r\n0.040443\r\nTorusMesh\r\n0.54022\r\nTubeTrailMesh\r\n0.096121\r\nRibbonTrailMesh\r\n0.074852\r\n```\r\n_note: Box, Plane, and Prism don't really change because they all were tested with default settings, With a higher subdivision, the difference is noticeable._\r\n\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>test script</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tprint(\"SphereMesh\")\r\n\tvar time = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = SphereMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.radius = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"BoxMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = BoxMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.size.x = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"CapsuleMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = CapsuleMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.radius = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"CylinderMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = CylinderMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.height = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"PlaneMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = PlaneMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.size.x = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"PrismMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = PrismMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.size.x = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"TorusMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = TorusMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.inner_radius = 0.2\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"TubeTrailMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = TubeTrailMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.radius = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\r\n\tprint(\"RibbonTrailMesh\")\r\n\ttime = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(num_instances):\r\n\t\tvar mesh = RibbonTrailMesh.new()\r\n\t\tmesh.size = 0.5\r\n\t\tvar mesh_instance = MeshInstance3D.new()\r\n\t\tmesh_instance.mesh = mesh\r\n\tprint((Time.get_ticks_usec()-time)/1000000.0)\r\n\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nIn the profiler the difference is very clear:\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n![Screenshot (423)](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8958cce-5d63-47f4-9bb7-4761e9edd9fa)\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n![Screenshot (421)](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a758438-2608-4212-bf32-fa017807cd08)\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}"